              ],
              "excerptSha256": "248c386baaeec8c7ef486f0dffe0923a5138daff766e5cf58c8c40cf8dbed62c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-local-to-global",
        "moduleId": "sloppy-counter",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "局部值如何变成全局值",
        "markdown": "局部值不能永远停在各核上，否则 `get` 看不到它们。局部计数器会定期在全局锁保护下把值转移给全局计数器，然后把自身清零。\n\n于是更新被分成两层：常见的快速路径只碰局部锁，偶尔的慢速路径才碰全局锁。扩展性来自前者，而全局可见性来自后者。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-sloppy-structure"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-sloppy-code",
        "moduleId": "sloppy-counter",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "懒惰计数器的实现",
        "markdown": "教材给出的实现把这一结构直接写进 `counter_t`：\n\n```c\ntypedef struct counter_t {\n    int global;\n    pthread_mutex_t glock;\n    int local[NUMCPUS];\n    pthread_mutex_t llock[NUMCPUS];\n    int threshold;\n} counter_t;\n\nvoid update(counter_t *c, int threadID, int amt) {\n    pthread_mutex_lock(&c->llock[threadID]);\n    c->local[threadID] += amt;\n    if (c->local[threadID] >= c->threshold) {\n        pthread_mutex_lock(&c->glock);\n        c->global += c->local[threadID];\n        pthread_mutex_unlock(&c->glock);\n        c->local[threadID] = 0;\n    }\n    pthread_mutex_unlock(&c->llock[threadID]);\n}\n```\n\n`get` 只读取全局计数器，因此返回的是**近似值**：还留在局部计数器里、尚未转移的更新暂时看不到。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "quote",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000381"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
